{"3480960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Roy", "steam_appid": 3480960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > 👉 Wishlist now to follow development and get notified at launch!<br> 👉 <strong>Join our Discord and be a part of the playtest!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/bf799fea671eec8f63438c63c22a7224.avif?t=1783342126\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/afc0d3a78a82e5f77a45e459d936f04c.poster.avif?t=1783342126\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/afc0d3a78a82e5f77a45e459d936f04c.webm?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/afc0d3a78a82e5f77a45e459d936f04c.mp4?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roy can<strong> hijack enemy robots</strong> in the middle of battle. Run low on health? Jump to another body. Outnumbered? Steal a stronger frame. Every fight becomes a puzzle of survival and opportunity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/a666cf9c8c8650bb831703fdb4c66a8b.avif?t=1783342126\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/4f262ad2c018003c381d3bf7ba1f47c6.poster.avif?t=1783342126\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/4f262ad2c018003c381d3bf7ba1f47c6.webm?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/4f262ad2c018003c381d3bf7ba1f47c6.mp4?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sullivan Corporation knows you’ve escaped. Their response? <strong>Unleashing waves of deadly machines</strong> to stop you. Fast reflexes and smart thinking are your only hope.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-based combat that gets harder with each round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face robots with unique AI, weapons, and attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic FPS chaos — shoot, strafe, slide, and dominate</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/2c1d6bea014001d54fb9a304334bc90a.avif?t=1783342126\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/c5214fdd164f66f1f2352fb8892bceae.poster.avif?t=1783342126\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/c5214fdd164f66f1f2352fb8892bceae.webm?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/c5214fdd164f66f1f2352fb8892bceae.mp4?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each robot you hijack completely changes how you fight — from agile run-and-gun Rangers to slow, brutal Tanks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ranger</strong> – Assault rifle, deployable shield, and grenade launcher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank</strong> – Minigun, gravitational pull, and a bullet-reflecting matrix</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trickster, Breacher, and more</strong> – Each with signature abilities, weapons, and playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/0f955b7442e18695cb6912c87b971cf7.avif?t=1783342126\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/1b4028678040bcef6bf17870925ef1a2.poster.avif?t=1783342126\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/1b4028678040bcef6bf17870925ef1a2.webm?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/1b4028678040bcef6bf17870925ef1a2.mp4?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every possession, every kill — makes you stronger. Customize each run with randomized upgrade cards, and evolve Roy’s AI between battles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Temporary Upgrades – Power-up on the fly with combat abilities and modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Roy Level Progression – Earn XP across runs to level up and push deeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize Your Build – Stack upgrades to suit your playstyle: brute force, control, or speed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/f563294fe9efe09dc9d008d6c88a9b3c.avif?t=1783342126\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sullivan Facility is a living labyrinth of high-tech experimentation and ruthless control. Can you make it out?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labs</strong> – Clinical, neon-lit testing chambers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Industrial Sectors</strong> – Steam-filled arenas and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate HQ</strong> – The final gauntlet… and your ultimate adversary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > 👉 Wishlist now to follow development and get notified at launch!<br> 👉 <strong>Join our Discord and be a part of the playtest!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/bf799fea671eec8f63438c63c22a7224.avif?t=1783342126\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/afc0d3a78a82e5f77a45e459d936f04c.poster.avif?t=1783342126\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/afc0d3a78a82e5f77a45e459d936f04c.webm?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/afc0d3a78a82e5f77a45e459d936f04c.mp4?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roy can<strong> hijack enemy robots</strong> in the middle of battle. Run low on health? Jump to another body. Outnumbered? Steal a stronger frame. Every fight becomes a puzzle of survival and opportunity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/a666cf9c8c8650bb831703fdb4c66a8b.avif?t=1783342126\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/4f262ad2c018003c381d3bf7ba1f47c6.poster.avif?t=1783342126\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/4f262ad2c018003c381d3bf7ba1f47c6.webm?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/4f262ad2c018003c381d3bf7ba1f47c6.mp4?t=1783342126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sullivan Corporation knows you’ve escaped. Their response? <strong>Unleashing waves of deadly machines</strong> to stop you. Fast reflexes and smart thinking are your only hope.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-based combat that gets harder with each round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face robots with unique AI, weapons, and attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic FPS chaos — shoot, strafe, slide, and dominate</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/2c1d6bea014001d54fb9a304334bc90a.avif?t=1783342126\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/c5214fdd164f66f